# Contact form delivery (both optional).
# With neither set, the form opens Gmail compose in a new tab with the message filled in.

# Best option: free key from https://web3forms.com (enter your email, the key arrives by mail).
# Messages then land straight in your inbox. This key is safe to expose in the browser.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=

# Alternative: any JSON form endpoint, for example a Formspree form URL.
VITE_FORM_ENDPOINT=
